== Verified primary gallery source ==
The original PC gallery URL [https://web.archive.org/web/20071218114834id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/anewhope/ls/letthewookieewin.gif was captured on 18 December 2007 at 11:48:34 UTC]. The native GIF SHA-256 is <code>7a3619a72f1c3f1c38501fbcadf0315e23e3755d0f3a71f98b2c120a561fbf56</code>; the downloaded payload matches the exact CDX digest. This capture is a known-by bound, not an original publication day. The printed uniqueness dot and bronze lower-right disc are visible; the corrected Play-on clause matches actual 29 January 2002 supplement, page 5. The later located 2017/2018/current sources use Target/Stack. No executable identifier is invented for this older image.

The source survey is bounded: three other earlier-gallery payloads remain unresolved and this correction is not a whole-source completeness claim.